WoFS BC_PREP - Parallel NetCDF Ensemble Mean Utility
====================================================

Requirements
------------
- MPI Fortran compiler (Intel mpiifort on NOAA Ursa)
- NetCDF-C
- NetCDF-Fortran
- Parallel-NetCDF

The appropriate platform compiler and library modules must be
loaded before building.

Build Instructions
------------------
1. Load the platform-specific compiler and library modules.

   On NOAA Ursa:

   module use ../../modulefiles
   module load ursa_bc_prep

2. Clean and rebuild:

   make clean
   make

3. Verify the installed executable:

   ls -lh ../../exec/average_netcdf_files_parallel.x

The Makefile automatically:
- Compiles average_netcdf_files_parallel.f90
- Checks runtime library dependencies
- Installs average_netcdf_files_parallel.x into ../../exec/

The executable is used by the WoFS BC_PREP MEAN workflow.

Notes
-----
The Makefile uses nc-config, nf-config, and pnetcdf-config
to locate the required libraries.

No user-specific installation paths are hardcoded.
